## 1. Overview

This document outlines the continuous improvement process for the {{ project_name }} AI system, ensuring ongoing enhancement of performance, safety, fairness, and compliance.

## 2. Improvement Cycle

### 2.1 Plan-Do-Check-Act (PDCA) Cycle

We follow the PDCA continuous improvement methodology:

1. **Plan:** Identify improvement opportunities and develop action plans
2. **Do:** Implement improvements in controlled manner
3. **Check:** Monitor and measure effectiveness
4. **Act:** Standardize successful improvements and iterate

### 2.2 Review Frequency

| Review Type | Frequency | Participants |
|-------------|-----------|--------------|
| Daily standup | Daily | Development team |
| Sprint retrospective | Every 2 weeks | Scrum team |
| Performance review | Monthly | Technical leads, data scientists |
| Compliance review | Quarterly | Compliance officer, legal, technical leads |
| Management review | Quarterly | Executive team, project owner |
| Annual assessment | Yearly | All stakeholders |

